.* SYSTEM2: the task menu for more general system tasks.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='SYSTEM2'.
:IMPORT NAME=PWRDWNSYS PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=SYSTEM2 HELP=HLPSYSTEM2 KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.General System Tasks
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='MENU PERFORM' HELP='SYSTEM2/OPT1'.Performance tools
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ASKQST' HELP='SYSTEM2/OPT2'.Question and answer
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='MENU PROBLEM' HELP='SYSTEM2/OPT3'.Problem handling
:MENUI OPTION=70 ACTION='MENU CMDSYS' HELP='SYSTEM2/OPT70'.Related commands
:MENUI OPTION=80 ACTION='CMD ?PWRDWNSYS' HELP=PWRDWNSYS.Power off the system
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPSYSTEM2.General System Tasks - Help
:P.The second page of system tasks. Option 80 prompts the command that ends
the system, so the way it ends can be chosen first.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F13=Information Assistant
:PD.Shows menu INFO.
:PT.F16=System Main menu
:PD.Shows menu MAIN.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SYSTEM2/OPT1'.Performance tools
:P.Option 1. Shows menu PERFORM&colon. Performance tools.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SYSTEM2/OPT2'.Question and answer
:P.Option 2. Runs the ASKQST command&colon. Question and answer.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SYSTEM2/OPT3'.Problem handling
:P.Option 3. Shows menu PROBLEM&colon. Problem handling.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SYSTEM2/OPT70'.Related commands
:P.Option 70. Shows menu CMDSYS&colon. Related commands.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
